  triage:snippet "rustls 0.23.43, RUSTSEC-2026-0285 / GHSA-2mjx-qc3c-rqvc (TLS 1.3 handshake messages accepted at the wrong encryption level); cargo-deny advisories check fails on every branch since 2026-09-14; reached via crates/atm-storage-rusqlite and crates/atm-peer-tls-interop (daemon/peer mTLS path); fix is cargo update -p rustls to >= 0.23.45" ;
  triage:status "fixed" ;
